{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bRendagor is a 2D Top-down Shooter starring a Rendagor Corporation service robot. Just another robot... or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Rendagor Corp.'s secrets in Story Mode or try your hand at the Arcade Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, shoot, smash, and blast enemies (and the game environment) with a large set of weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>'free-will.deb' virus</strong> has corrupted Rendagor Corp's core, twisting the AI-CEO into a sentient, merciless tyrant. Infiltrate the headquarters, neutralize the madness, and save humanity from the cold grip of a machine god gone rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against the failed experiments of Rendagor Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bone-crushing Rocket Fists to high-tech lasers: wield a devastating arsenal to tear through Rendagor Corp's defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour every corner and crack environmental puzzles to uncover hidden caches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order on the fly with R-Coins. Watch the skies\u2014your R-Shipping courier is already en route.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=436 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your chassis and overclock your power with rare R-Chips.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=452 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your arsenal against massive, unique bosses at the end of every zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=344 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash chaos with rocket fists and lasers! Battle through unpredictable waves of Rendagor Corp's minions, solving puzzles for loot and spending R-Coins on drone-delivered supplies. Draft powerful upgrades, customize your robot, and annihilate the ultimate boss to reclaim your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes against dynamic waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/243bc99a4539ed80c8205a6c3b86d617.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/243bc99a4539ed80c8205a6c3b86d617.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/243bc99a4539ed80c8205a6c3b86d617.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap the spoils of war: collect R-Chips and <strong>select powerful perks</strong> to prepare for the next onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/93ca5f237e73a6a5e6dbc1b79c69cc80.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/93ca5f237e73a6a5e6dbc1b79c69cc80.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/93ca5f237e73a6a5e6dbc1b79c69cc80.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, just action. Survive the waves and scrap the Final Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/d781c55bc2504472b48a7231cdffcba3.poster.avif?t=1772624025\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/d781c55bc2504472b48a7231cdffcba3.webm?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/d781c55bc2504472b48a7231cdffcba3.mp4?t=1772624025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343710?t=1772624025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343710?t=1772624025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/46aed89b81972e5d438a1d2d57e1e8edf18aec38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772624025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/46aed89b81972e5d438a1d2d57e1e8edf18aec38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772624025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Killings of people and animals"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3372070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bRendagor is a 2D Top-down Shooter starring a Rendagor Corporation service robot. Just another robot... or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Rendagor Corp.'s secrets in Story Mode or try your hand at the Arcade Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, shoot, smash, and blast enemies (and the game environment) with a large set of weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>'free-will